<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Happy Birthday 🎉</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4);
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .card {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      max-width: 600px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
    }

    .funny {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    .emotional {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .heart {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    iframe {
      margin-top: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 15px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #555;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="card">
    <h1>🎂 Happy Birthday 🎉</h1>

    <p class="funny">
      Another year older, but don’t worry…  
      you’re still younger than your future self 😄
    </p>

    <div class="heart">❤️✨❤️</div>

    <p class="emotional">
      Today isn’t just about cake and gifts.  
      It’s about celebrating *you* — your heart, your smile,
      and the love you bring into people’s lives.
      <br><br>
      No matter where life takes you, remember:
      you are cared for, appreciated, and truly special.
    </p>

    <h3>🎶 Karan Aujla Birthday Vibe 🔥</h3>

    <!-- SAFE Spotify Track Embed -->
    <iframe 
      src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/4Q0NH5XbZb0lQ5i4TqC3Cj"
      width="100%" 
      height="152"
      frameborder="0"
      allow="encrypted-media">
    </iframe>

    <footer>
      Made with love, care & good vibes 💫
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
